SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Pittsburg Valley Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Route link:** [Phil's Hills: Pittsburg Valley Repeats](https://ridewithgps
 .com/routes/53982043)\n**PDF link:** [Cuesheet](https://s3.us-east-1.amazo
 naws.com/assets.modomadethis.com/cuesheets/Phils_Hills_Pittsburg_Valley_Re
 peats.pdf)\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a total distance of a
 pproximately **15-20 miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of a circuit featur
 ing **1-2 climbing segment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasize maintaining a 
 consistent climbing tempo\, active recovery between efforts\, and repeatin
 g the effort to build power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** We'll maintain a 
 comfortable average pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-Drop Policy:** Yo
 u'll never be left behind! We'll regroup after climbs to ensure everyone s
 tays together.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds or audibl
 e music-playing devices. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spar
 e tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
