 h is having a retreat weekend at the Bird In hand resort. Join us Friday a
 fternoon for the short & Sweet Ice Cream ride.\nRide Start: 3:00PM\nRide N
 ame: Short & Sweet Ice Cream Ride\n[https://ridewithgps.com/routes/3021366
 0](https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fridewi
 thgps.com%2Froutes%2F30213660&data=05%7C02%7C%7Ca6fb95bab26c4cccdb3708debd
