SUMMARY:Challenging Ride (A) -  EP BC Classic (48R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nAnticipated average pace:
  **18-20 mph**\n\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/27490213\n\n**This is a C
 hallenging (A) level ride and intended to be a NO DROP RIDE.** The ride le
 ader will ride at the advertised average speed and will do his/her best to
  keep the group together with regroupings and a sweeper may also be appoin
 ted at the start. **Please do not join this ride if you are not willing to
  stick with the group.** If maintaining an 18-20mph average is beyond your
  current ability level\, please consider joining an "Advanced" ride first.
 \n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repa
 ir kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate pas
 sing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require an LBC Club membership and
  Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you
  are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.
 aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide b
 y the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\,\n\n[Rules of the Road
 ](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257
 148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/do
 cs.ashx?id=454318)
